# Python Project for Data Science

This folder contains my hands-on projects and assignments from the IBM Data Analyst Professional Certificate.

## Course Overview

This module applies Python programming concepts and data analysis techniques to explore real-world data and extract meaningful insights.
It focuses on acquiring and interpreting key stock market data and analysing stock trends to make data-driven decisions based on visual insights 

## Tools and Technologies
- Python
- Jupyter Notebook
- Pandas
- Data Visualization libraries

## Project Objectives
- Apply Python programming skills to data analysis.
- Work with datasets using Python.
- Perform data exploration and analysis.
- Present findings through visualizations and analysis.
